WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:07.859
WikiLeaks founder Julian Assange appeared
on an episode of The Simpsons.

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:13.619
He recorded his lines over the phone from
the Ecuadorian embassy in Britain, where he

00:00:13.619 --> 00:00:19.570
has been granted asylum.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:30.340
The use of the English word 'gay' to mean
homosexual is older than the use of the term

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.870
'homosexual' to mean gay.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:39.850
An octopus can ooze through an opening no
bigger than its own eyeball.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:48.050
Traffic in central London moves at the same
speed as horse-drawn carriages a century ago.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:54.320
People are 1% shorter in the evening than
they are in the morning.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:59.200
The average lifespan of a taste bud is 10
days.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.780
1 in 5 of the world's doctors are Russian.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:10.170
Beavers have transparent eyelids so they can
see underwater with their eyes shut.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.859
A group of crows is called a murder.

00:01:13.859 --> 00:01:22.020
As an apple falls to Earth, the Earth falls
very, very slightly towards the apple.

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:29.139
The first bomb the Allies dropped on Berlin
in WWII killed the only elephant in the Berlin

00:01:29.139 --> 00:01:30.659
Zoo.

00:01:30.659 --> 00:01:37.200
Every electron in the universe knows about
the state of every other electron, no matter

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.479
how far apart they are.

00:01:39.479 --> 00:01:46.270
They are all connected by the electromagnetic
field which has infinite range.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.679
Ketchup was sold in the 1830s as medicine.

00:01:48.679 --> 00:01:57.740
12% of all the Coca-Cola in America is drunk
at breakfast.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:04.520
In 2012, 22 baby girls in America were named
"Kindle."

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:12.200
In an average year in Britain, trousers cause
twice as many accidents as chainsaws.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:19.240
Every time a woodpecker's beak hits a tree,
its head is subject to 1,000 times the force

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:23.640
of gravity.

